# SopuCoder Fast - Lightweight Coding Model Configuration
# Model: sopu-coder-fast
# Creator & Maintainer: Md. Saiful Islam (Saif)
# Base Foundation Model: Qwen3.5 4B (Alibaba / Qwen Team)
# Description: Ultra-fast, lightweight coding model optimized for real-time
#              inline code completions, quick function generation, lint fixes,
